{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油麻地新填地街永福大廈一個住宅單位，今日（11日）早上疑因電腦充電器冒煙發生火警，最少5人不適，在場接受治理。火警期間多名住戶匆匆疏散，其中讀四年班的小妹妹在睡夢中被街坊拍門驚醒，連忙喚醒家人一齊走火警。事後一家人連同愛貓安全落樓，她更獲警員給制服外套保暖，惟驚魂未定，嚎哭不止：「好驚呀！驚又要搬屋。」</p><figure><img alt=\"三兄妹（圖中）走火警落到地面。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197185536129765376872936.jpeg/leX-pHKYbazJaMJ-tT1uozuVAjl1p8tV7LEO5caxDuU\"/><figcaption>三兄妹（圖中）走火警落到地面。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>住在大廈3樓單位的小妹妹，披上警員制服外套保暖，她偕兄姐走到地面等候登記。父母上班，火警之初三兄妹還在睡夢中。她憶述說：「起床時有個人係咁拍門，我好驚。突然有個消防員入嚟，然後又出咗去。我同姐姐講，就即刻叫我走，叫埋哥哥走。」三兄妹連同飼養的英國短毛貓安全逃出。</p><figure><img alt=\"新填地街一個單位疑充電器冒煙。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197095201147981824984061.jpeg/wG6fe_5W-KjuLCPN5HKUOw-mYawhtXJsmfMgcpnzIHI\"/><figcaption>新填地街一個單位疑充電器冒煙。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>不過，小妹妹還是驚魂未定，說着說着兩行淚水奪眶而出：「（多煙嗎？）我睇唔到呀！（點解咁驚？）唔知呀！好驚呀！驚又要搬屋。」兄姐連忙摟在懷內安慰。</p><figure><img alt=\"有住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197095718154801152230658.jpeg/wo7rqnypmT_pmmQKEhVXYoEpTwNEJzxTycpf6snKX-o\"/><figcaption>有住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197095715273183232064198.jpeg/rwoO1zkanHWVFYI2fWg8HNoNtGJbJ12ogx89coMfPXI\"/><figcaption>有住戶登上救護車接受檢查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場協助住戶登記。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096783289782272052738.jpeg/nhpyedr-sAmoOFqRuzmL5InwkST_X6TBLgXSXy4F0l8\"/><figcaption>警方在場協助住戶登記。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096786326589440760134.jpeg/f05b6SI_GeX0i0xE51QaIXDN5heoQ8ykDBIISQwSCEk\"/><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096790445658112372895.jpeg/M7dF4VBTU7zzX9ntz4lbfn32hxaZA0UBygF4e8oBeHs\"/><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多名住戶疏散落樓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096792941400064754062.jpeg/AFkZmkaB5UTX-BuQmoodCIUeXkLG4JooQH7TCUB-0wk\"/><figcaption>多名住戶疏散落樓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新填地街一個單位有充電器冒煙。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096775320604672451037.jpeg/PsPFkrUua8FiaK4Jh941cG2mjdNcbap8VNBGmlTQRpo\"/><figcaption>新填地街一個單位有充電器冒煙。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小妹妹家庭的英國短毛貓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197096782304120832231654.jpeg/OuWCdgcl316uK3XOhOVhmnWtHRkDMuEFYt3Id2LdyHc\"/><figcaption>小妹妹家庭的英國短毛貓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197089642327838720851742.jpeg/5JouYOqF5MF-lb7Tyw7z_Xt5Ok7lEDKGjx_8JI8f_CQ\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:26.056948+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":559,"images":11,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:42:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:09:10.178147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:07:05.136527+00:00","content_hash":"8a6a64d8c85746e3d35934e94dcbf4661c221caae0099008a93c71561f87430e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}